Package: Hozo
Title: Estimate Mean and Standard Deviation from Median and Range
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Sepehr", "Khosravi", , "khosravisepehr@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-5372-0787"))
Description: Many clinical studies report the median and range of an
    outcome instead of its mean and standard deviation, which makes them
    hard to pool in a meta-analysis. Implements the estimators of Hozo,
    Djulbegovic and Hozo (2005) <doi:10.1186/1471-2288-5-13> for the mean,
    standard deviation and variance of a sample from its median, minimum,
    maximum and size. For each study, the estimator is chosen by sample
    size, as the authors recommend. The inputs are vectorised, so one call
    converts a whole table of studies.
